{"id":"CF-CLASICO-WHY","mode":"final","audio":[{"src":"audio/explainer/clasico/josh.mp3","at":0}],"beats":[{"id":"b01","v":"kits","text":"Why do we call Barça versus Real Madrid El Clásico?","s":0,"e":3.52},{"id":"b02","v":"ball","text":"And where did this rivalry really begin?","s":4.22,"e":6.14},{"id":"b03","v":"name","text":"El Clásico simply means \"the classic.\"","s":7.02,"e":8.98},{"id":"b04","v":"ticket","text":"Their first meeting goes back to May thirteenth, nineteen-oh-two,","s":9.82,"e":14.08},{"id":"b05","v":"crown","text":"in a cup held for the coronation of King Alfonso the Thirteenth.","s":14.08,"e":19.045714285714286},{"id":"b06","v":"score","text":"Barça won, three to one.","s":19.045714285714286,"e":20.62},{"id":"b07","v":"mystery","text":"And here's the fun part: their opponent wasn't even called Real Madrid yet.","s":21.04,"e":26.1},{"id":"b08","v":"madridfc","text":"It was just Madrid Football Club.","s":26.82,"e":28.76},{"id":"b09","v":"royal","text":"The word \"Real,\" meaning royal, only came in nineteen-twenty, a gift from the king.","s":29.72,"e":34.48},{"id":"b10","v":"liga","text":"Then, in nineteen twenty-nine, La Liga began.","s":35.5,"e":38.28},{"id":"b11","v":"trophy","text":"Now they met every season, and Barça won the very first title.","s":39.36,"e":42.92},{"id":"b12","v":"fifties","text":"In the fifties, the fight moved off the pitch.","s":43.94,"e":45.96},{"id":"b13","v":"distefano","text":"Both clubs wanted the same superstar: Alfredo Di Stéfano.","s":46.78,"e":51},{"id":"b14","v":"cups","text":"After a messy saga, he ended up in Madrid, and won five European Cups in a row.","s":51.68,"e":56.76},{"id":"b15","v":"catalonia","text":"Barcelona became a symbol of Catalan culture.","s":58.14,"e":60.3},{"id":"b16","v":"capital","text":"Madrid was the big club of the capital.","s":61.36,"e":62.88},{"id":"b17","v":"split","text":"So every match meant more than football.","s":63.76,"e":65.62},{"id":"b18","v":"eras","text":"Then came new